# =============================================================================
# Apple Intelligence + Photos Extend / Spatial Reframing + Siri AI + ChatGPT
# Loon Remote Rule (.lsr) | Updated: 2026-10-28
# Repository: https://github.com/fucknima/loon
#
# Usage / 使用方法：
# [Remote Rule]
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fucknima/loon/main/Apple_Intelligence.lsr, policy=AppleAI, tag=Apple Intelligence, enabled=true
#
# IMPORTANT:
# 1. Policy is selected in Loon's Remote Rule; these rules have NO policy field.
# 2. Prefer a stable eligible-region node; verify TCP/UDP 443 connectivity.
# 3. Never MITM/decrypt Apple's encrypted AI relay endpoints.
# 4. This file is NOT a region-unlock mechanism and cannot override device eligibility.
# 5. Avoid proxying all apple.com, icloud.com, mzstatic.com or apple-dns.net.
# 6. Keep Apple AI policy consistent with ChatGPT extension sign-in when testing.
#
# Source A (official):
# https://support.apple.com/zh-cn/101555
# Source B (Apple Intelligence + ChatGPT setup):
# https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10269382-setting-up-chatgpt-with-apple-intelligence
# Source C (OpenAI domain allowlist):
# https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9247338-network-recommendations-for-chatgpt-errors-on-web-and-apps
# Source D (community, NOT Apple confirmation):
# https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/issues/504
# =============================================================================


# =============================================================================
# A. Apple 官方明确列出的 AI / Siri 网络端点（6 条）
# =============================================================================

# Apple Intelligence Extensions：Apple 智能扩展
DOMAIN,apple-relay.apple.com

# Private Cloud Compute (PCC)：私有云计算，TCP/UDP 443
# iOS 27 照片 App 高级编辑共享 PCC 通道：
# - 扩图 / 扩展（Photos Extend）：生成照片边缘缺失内容
# - 空间构图（Spatial Reframing）：本机预览构图，云端生成补全
# - 增强版消除（Improved Clean Up）：复杂编辑可能使用云端模型
# - 图乐园（Image Playground）：新一代生成模型也使用 PCC
# 说明：这些功能没有 Apple 官方公布的独立专用域名；
# 下方为 Apple 官方披露的共享 PCC 域名，不能保证所有请求均被代理。
# Photo features: https://support.apple.com/en-us/121115
# WWDC26 explanation: https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2026/101/
DOMAIN,apple-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com

# Siri / 听写请求，TCP 443
DOMAIN,guzzoni.apple.com

# Siri / Spotlight / Safari 等搜索服务，TCP 443
# 使用后缀匹配官方的 *.smoot.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com


# =============================================================================
# B. 兼容性补充（5 条）
# 2026-04 社区报告可改善 Apple Intelligence / ChatGPT 扩展登录。
# 与官方「AI 专用域名」不同，部分端点还服务于其他 Apple 功能。
# =============================================================================

# CloudKit 内容网关；可能同时影响其他 iCloud/系统内容访问
DOMAIN,gateway.icloud.com

# Apple 媒体资源域名；可能同时影响商店资源
DOMAIN,aapps.mzstatic.com

# Apple 地理位置/关联服务端点（社区补充）
DOMAIN,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com

# 其他 Apple relay / CDN 端点（社区补充）
DOMAIN,apple-relay.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,apple-relay.mask.apple-dns.net


# =============================================================================
# C. OpenAI / ChatGPT 扩展相关（6 条）
# OpenAI 官方域名允许列表；并非表示所有端点必然由苹果扩展调用。
# 精确限定在 OpenAI 自有域名，避免影响常规苹果服务。
# =============================================================================

# ChatGPT API、帐号登录、扩展调用
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com

# Web 静态资源 / 对话附件 / 实验服务
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatsig.com

# OpenAI 前端 CDN
DOMAIN,cdn.openaimerge.com


# =============================================================================
# D. 可选：只有抓到登录失败或挑战页面对应域名时才启用
# 请删除行首的 "# " 来启用；这些是多站点共用服务，默认不代理。
# OpenAI 官方网络列表包含这些域名，但不能证明苹果扩展必然用到。
# =============================================================================
# DOMAIN,cdn.workos.com
# DOMAIN,setup.workos.com
# DOMAIN,forwarder.workos.com
# DOMAIN,frontend-apps-multi-region.workos.com
# DOMAIN,images.workoscdn.com
# DOMAIN,workos.imgix.net
# DOMAIN,challenges.cloudflare.com


# =============================================================================
# E. 刻意不加入 / Exclusions (NOT rules)
#
# apple.com / icloud.com / apple-dns.net / mzstatic.com 整站
# 17.0.0.0/8 全部苹果网段
# mask.icloud.com / mask-api.icloud.com：iCloud Private Relay
# humb.apple.com / idmsa.apple.com：设备与 Apple 帐户通用认证
# 以上流量可能影响 App Store、iCloud、设备激活或隐私转送。
# =============================================================================
